---
description: No AI attribution in commits or PRs, and no Test plan section
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git and PR attribution

When committing or opening a pull request:

- Do not add `Co-authored-by`, `Made-with: Cursor`, `Made with Cursor`, or any Cursor/Claude trailer to the commit message or PR body.
- Do not include a `## Test plan` section (or any test-plan checklist) in the PR body.
- Keep the PR body to a short Summary only.
- If a trailer is injected anyway, strip it before push (`git log -1` must not show it).
